  "notes": "USAGE:\n{転載|てんさい} refers specifically to reproducing or reposting content from one medium or platform to another. It is commonly seen in copyright notices on websites and publications.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- を{転載|てんさい}する (to repost/reprint something)\n- からの{転載|てんさい} (reprint from...)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {無断|むだん}{転載|てんさい} (unauthorized reproduction)\n- {転載|てんさい}{禁止|きんし} (reproduction prohibited)\n- {記事|きじ}を{転載|てんさい}する (repost an article)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{転載|てんさい} focuses on reproducing content across platforms. Compare with {引用|いんよう} (quotation), which refers to citing a portion of someone's work with attribution.",
